  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis PR adds four MCP post tools (`crates/app/src/mcp/post_tools.rs`):\n\n- `list_posts` lists each built-in post and each `.cps` file in the user posts folder. Each row gives the machine kinds that the post serves, `description`, `program_units`, `extension` and the declared options. A file that does not load gives its `problem`. `selected` is the document's post.\n- `select_post` runs `SelectPost` through the session History. It is one undo step. `null` selects the default built-in post.\n- `preview_post` runs a script (`source` or `path`) on a built-in sample (Facing, Contour, Pocket, Drilling) or on the document stream. It writes no file. It returns `ok`, `program`, `lines`, `warnings` and `swallowed`. A failed script returns `ok: false` and `errors` with the 1-based `line` in the script. The Boa runtime limits stop a script that loops.\n- `save_post_script` saves a plain file name in the user posts folder. The folder is `CAMCRAFT_POSTS`, else `<data dir>/camcraft/posts` (the same order as the user machines folder). The script must load and run before the save. An existing file is replaced only with `overwrite: true`. The write is atomic.\n\nOther changes:\n\n- In a live app session, `save_post_script` needs approval as a `FileWrite`, and `select_post` as a `LimitEdit` (`mcp::live::requires_approval`).\n- A hidden test hook `Server::set_user_posts_dir` (an `Env` field) points the folder at a temp folder.\n- `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md` is generated again (128 tools). `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` has the four rows. `site/content/guide/automate/mcp.md` has a \"Post scripts\" section.\n- The decision file is `docs/decisions/2074-mcp-post-tools.md`.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `mcp` suite, `post_tools::*` (6 tests):\n  - `list_posts_lists_every_builtin_post_with_what_it_declares`\n  - `select_post_is_one_undo_step_and_refuses_a_stranger` (undo and redo)\n  - `preview_post_runs_a_script_on_a_sample_and_writes_no_file` (output, warnings, no file)\n  - `preview_post_returns_the_1_based_line_of_a_syntax_error_and_stops_a_loop`\n  - `save_post_script_writes_a_plain_name_into_the_user_posts_folder_only`\n  - `a_live_session_asks_before_a_post_file_write_or_a_post_choice`\n- `camcraft-app` lib: `mcp::post_files::tests::*` (folder order, plain names) and `mcp::post_tools::tests::the_error_line_reads_the_script_position`.\n\n## Readings\n\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`, head 362ab7198): 176 steps, 1 failed: `mcp_doc_drift` (`every_live_tool_is_in_the_guide_and_the_local_prompt`). The site MCP guide did not name the new tools. a8890b3a1 adds them; `mcp_doc_drift` (9 tests) and the `mcp` suite (62 tests) pass on the final head.\n- Site tests (`python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests`): no failure that main does not have.\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-app -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- The heavy lanes: this diff changes no generator or post output.\n- A real per-user data folder: the tests use a temp folder through the hook. The folder order is a unit test.\n\nProcess change: yes (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` gets the four tool rows, as the issue asks).\n\nChangelog: MCP: `list_posts`, `select_post` (undoable), `preview_post` (read-only, no file written) and `save_post_script` (a plain file name in the user posts folder, `CAMCRAFT_POSTS`) tools for post authoring and selection.\n\nFixes #2074\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
